Description: retro screensavers for Wayland desktops
 A collection of screensavers with original pixel art: flying toasters,
 3D pipes, a starfield, mystify, matrix rain, an aquarium, a lava lamp and
 a bouncing name banner.
 .
 The screensaver starts after a period without input and goes away on any
 key, click, touch or mouse movement. It never blocks screen blanking, and
 apps that inhibit idle (such as video players) keep it from starting.
 .
 Includes a fullscreen picker with big tiles that young children can use,
 with a settings page behind it (hold the gear) for timings, an optional
 drifting clock, power saving and an on/off switch. Works with labwc (Raspberry Pi OS), Wayfire, sway and
 other wlroots-based compositors.
